{
  "name": "Orders",
  "description": "⚠️ PERUBAHAN: order sekarang per-VARIANT (variantId), bukan per-produk (productId) lagi — lihat OrderItemRequest.\n\n⚠️ PERHATIAN: CreateOrderRequest.CustomerID sekarang punya tag `binding:\"required\"`. Body request WAJIB mengirim customerId != 0 supaya lolos ShouldBindJSON, walau handler tetap meng-overwrite-nya dengan loggedInUserID setelah binding (req.CustomerID = loggedInUserID). Jadi nilai yang kamu kirim di body customerId TIDAK berpengaruh ke hasil akhir — cuma untuk lolos validasi. Kita pakai {{customerId}} (hasil login) sebagai placeholder aman.\n\n⚠️ KEMUNGKINAN REGRESI: kalau variant tidak ditemukan, service sekarang return ErrorVariantNotFound (bukan ErrorProductNotFound). handler.go (versi terakhir yang kamu upload) masih mem-branch errors.Is(err, ErrorProductNotFound) untuk balas 404 — kemungkinan sekarang variant-not-found jatuh ke 500, bukan 404. Test terkait di bawah menerima [404,500] dengan catatan.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Place Order",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": {{customerId}},\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variantId\": {{variantId}},\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "customerId wajib diisi (binding:required) tapi nilainya akan di-overwrite server dari token — kirim {{customerId}} saja. variantId didapat dari List Products atau Create Product (Admin)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Order placed (200/201)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if ([200, 201].includes(pm.response.code)) {",
              "    const body = pm.response.json();",
              "    const data = body.data || body;",
              "    const id = data.id || data.ID || data.orderId;",
              "    if (id) {",
              "        pm.environment.set('orderId', id);",
              "        console.log('orderId tersimpan otomatis: ' + id);",
              "    }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Place Order - customerId Kosong (harus 400)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": 0,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variantId\": {{variantId}},\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "Negative test BARU: customerId = 0 melanggar binding:required di CreateOrderRequest -> gagal ShouldBindJSON -> 400."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('customerId kosong -> 400', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Place Order - Variant Tidak Ditemukan",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": {{customerId}},\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variantId\": 999999999,\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "Negative test: variantId tidak ada -> service.ErrorVariantNotFound. Lihat catatan '⚠️ KEMUNGKINAN REGRESI' di deskripsi folder."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('[Cek regresi] Variant tidak ditemukan -> idealnya 404, tapi bisa jadi 500', function () {",
              "    pm.expect([404, 500]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Place Order - Stok Tidak Cukup",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": {{customerId}},\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"variantId\": {{variantId}},\n      \"quantity\": 999999\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["orders"]
        },
        "description": "Negative test: quantity melebihi stok -> ErrorProductNoStock -> 409 (tidak berubah)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Stok tidak cukup -> 409', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "List My Orders",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/customer/{{customerId}}?page=1&limit=10",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["orders", "customer", "{{customerId}}"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
            { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "List Orders By Customer - IDOR Check (harus 403)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/customer/999999",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["orders", "customer", "999999"]
        },
        "description": "Negative test penting: coba akses data customer lain -> harus 403 (validasi IDOR di handler, tidak berubah)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Akses data customer lain -> 403 (IDOR terlindungi)', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
